# Who must approve a pull request into main. The ruleset requires a code
# owner's review and no other approvals, so a pull request that touches
# only files without an owner can be merged by its author once CI passes.
#
# Mark owns everything: the registry (addons.toml, scripts/), the
# workflows, this file, and his add-ons.
*                               @MarkNygaard

# Shared files every add-on's release or dependencies change. Unowned, so
# a release pull request or a new dependency doesn't wait on Mark; CI
# still checks every build.
/.release-please-manifest.json
/addons/Cargo.lock

# Add-ons someone else owns, with no owner here, so their author merges
# their own pull requests. Adding a folder here is Mark's decision.
# /addons/<name>/
